From: neilt-GFmLFdZw/U84Q++5jOxPmw at public.gmane.org (Neil Tiffin)
Date: Thu, 20 Feb 2014 18:28:18 -0600
Subject: Re: I can't connect to remote db with RPostgreSQL
In-Reply-To: <4712aeac-c24b-401b-8fee-14304070d942@googlegroups.com>
