Diego:

I use SSH tunneling for this.

ssh -L 5433:localhost:5432 myUser@myHost

and then

library(RPostgreSQL)
drv <- dbDriver("PostgreSQL");
con <- dbConnect(drv,
                 user="myUser",
                 password="myPassword",
                 dbname="myDB",
                 host="localhost",
                 port=5433);


This assumes that myPort below is 5432.

-Ian

